{"5262310":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Returns Desk: A Cozy Library","steam_appid":5262310,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy tidy-up game for VR<\/strong> The library has been closed for years, and the returns desk is full. You are the librarian. Pick up a book, read its cover, carry it to its shelf and slide it into its slot, by hand. 864 books, eight wings, one Victorian rotunda to put back in order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/988689a59fdcb3f157c653e0d6d3bc43.avif?t=1793757771\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras_big\/988689a59fdcb3f157c653e0d6d3bc43.avif?t=1793757771 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every book tells you where it goes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing lights up the answer and nothing sorts itself. The cover has all you need:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The emblem and color<\/strong> point to one of the eight wings, and the shade narrows it down further.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The title<\/strong> is the row. Every shelf is labeled.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The volume number<\/strong> is the slot, one to nine.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first you follow the colors. Soon you walk straight to the numbers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some books come back damaged. Rub them clean before they go on the shelf.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/125f880665837c2c5fa27d603a7b8e65.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/125f880665837c2c5fa27d603a7b8e65.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/125f880665837c2c5fa27d603a7b8e65.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open the library, one wing at a time<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every row you finish earns a point. Spend points at the rewards lectern to open another wing: its lanterns light up and its banner takes its color. You choose which wing opens first.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a4447d08d49dd683749579583e4546f8.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Wing Opening\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a4447d08d49dd683749579583e4546f8.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a4447d08d49dd683749579583e4546f8.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Points also buy help with the carrying, never with the searching:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A book basket<\/strong> that holds four books<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger deliveries<\/strong> of 30, 40 and 50 books at the desk<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A repair brush<\/strong> for damaged books<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon<\/strong>, to pull a book or the basket into your hand from across the room<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Hands<\/strong>, to clean a damaged book the moment you pick it up<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rain on the glass, at the hour you like<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the weather back: rain on the dome, snow, wind, and a storm with thunder. Earn the time of day too, five hours from dawn to night, or set an hour of your own. Pick them at the lectern, choose how heavy the rain falls, or let the weather change on its own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/36d8942d7e5144e661d2e25cf55580b1.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Storm Over The Dome\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/36d8942d7e5144e661d2e25cf55580b1.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/36d8942d7e5144e661d2e25cf55580b1.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The reading room<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the rotunda is a quieter room to open for yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/81f571702fd1ea5e3ad23e58159d5bca.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Fireplace\/Hearth\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/81f571702fd1ea5e3ad23e58159d5bca.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/81f571702fd1ea5e3ad23e58159d5bca.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fire<\/strong> to poke with the irons until it flares<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gramophone<\/strong> with four records: put one on, wind the crank and listen<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Display cases and a trophy shelf<\/strong> that fill as you work: a volume for every row you finish, a trophy for every wing, and a faint outline where the ones still to come will stand<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a137d23a1c43ebb19bc96c7d542d0019.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Gramophone\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a137d23a1c43ebb19bc96c7d542d0019.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a137d23a1c43ebb19bc96c7d542d0019.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for your hands<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hands close around what you hold: a book by its edge or its corner, the basket by its handle, a record by its rim, a fire iron by its shaft.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No hurry<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing organizing game with no timers, no score, no fail state, and nobody else in the library. The game saves as you go, so you can take the headset off mid-shelf and pick up where you left off.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comfort and settings<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seated or standing play, with a crouch button<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport or smooth movement<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap or smooth turning, with adjustable angle and speed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort vignette with adjustable strength<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left- or right-handed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haptics on or off<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master, ambience and effects volume<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics settings for shadows, anti-aliasing, textures and detail<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good to know<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR only. There is no flat-screen mode.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needs tracked motion controllers. Hand tracking is not supported.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player. English text, no voice acting.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy tidy-up game for VR<\/strong> The library has been closed for years, and the returns desk is full. You are the librarian. Pick up a book, read its cover, carry it to its shelf and slide it into its slot, by hand. 864 books, eight wings, one Victorian rotunda to put back in order.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/988689a59fdcb3f157c653e0d6d3bc43.avif?t=1793757771\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras_big\/988689a59fdcb3f157c653e0d6d3bc43.avif?t=1793757771 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every book tells you where it goes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing lights up the answer and nothing sorts itself. The cover has all you need:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The emblem and color<\/strong> point to one of the eight wings, and the shade narrows it down further.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The title<\/strong> is the row. Every shelf is labeled.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The volume number<\/strong> is the slot, one to nine.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first you follow the colors. Soon you walk straight to the numbers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some books come back damaged. Rub them clean before they go on the shelf.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/125f880665837c2c5fa27d603a7b8e65.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/125f880665837c2c5fa27d603a7b8e65.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/125f880665837c2c5fa27d603a7b8e65.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open the library, one wing at a time<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every row you finish earns a point. Spend points at the rewards lectern to open another wing: its lanterns light up and its banner takes its color. You choose which wing opens first.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a4447d08d49dd683749579583e4546f8.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Wing Opening\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a4447d08d49dd683749579583e4546f8.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a4447d08d49dd683749579583e4546f8.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Points also buy help with the carrying, never with the searching:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A book basket<\/strong> that holds four books<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger deliveries<\/strong> of 30, 40 and 50 books at the desk<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A repair brush<\/strong> for damaged books<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon<\/strong>, to pull a book or the basket into your hand from across the room<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Hands<\/strong>, to clean a damaged book the moment you pick it up<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rain on the glass, at the hour you like<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the weather back: rain on the dome, snow, wind, and a storm with thunder. Earn the time of day too, five hours from dawn to night, or set an hour of your own. Pick them at the lectern, choose how heavy the rain falls, or let the weather change on its own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/36d8942d7e5144e661d2e25cf55580b1.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Storm Over The Dome\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/36d8942d7e5144e661d2e25cf55580b1.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/36d8942d7e5144e661d2e25cf55580b1.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The reading room<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the rotunda is a quieter room to open for yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/81f571702fd1ea5e3ad23e58159d5bca.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Fireplace\/Hearth\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/81f571702fd1ea5e3ad23e58159d5bca.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/81f571702fd1ea5e3ad23e58159d5bca.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fire<\/strong> to poke with the irons until it flares<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gramophone<\/strong> with four records: put one on, wind the crank and listen<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Display cases and a trophy shelf<\/strong> that fill as you work: a volume for every row you finish, a trophy for every wing, and a faint outline where the ones still to come will stand<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a137d23a1c43ebb19bc96c7d542d0019.poster.avif?t=1793757771\" aria-label=\"Gramophone\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a137d23a1c43ebb19bc96c7d542d0019.webm?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5262310\/extras\/a137d23a1c43ebb19bc96c7d542d0019.mp4?t=1793757771\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for your hands<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hands close around what you hold: a book by its edge or its corner, the basket by its handle, a record by its rim, a fire iron by its shaft.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No hurry<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing organizing game with no timers, no score, no fail state, and nobody else in the library. The game saves as you go, so you can take the headset off mid-shelf and pick up where you left off.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comfort and settings<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seated or standing play, with a crouch button<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport or smooth movement<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap or smooth turning, with adjustable angle and speed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort vignette with adjustable strength<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left- or right-handed<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haptics on or off<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master, ambience and effects volume<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics settings for shadows, anti-aliasing, textures and detail<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good to know<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR only. There is no flat-screen mode.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needs tracked motion controllers. Hand tracking is not supported.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player. English text, no voice acting.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A cozy tidy-up game for VR. Put 864 books back where they belong in a Victorian rotunda library, by hand. Every cover tells you its wing, its row and its slot, and nothing sorts itself. Finished rows open new wings and bring back the weather and the hours of the day. No time